Benchmark runs are written here as results/run_<timestamp>/ (plan §5):

  run_<timestamp>/
  ├── report.md            Markdown comparison report
  ├── hardware_spec.json   Environment snapshot (plan §7.2)
  ├── raw_metrics.json     Every BenchmarkResult, unrounded
  ├── results.csv          Flat export for plot_results.py
  ├── flamegraphs/         Per-candidate CPU profiles (plan §5)
  └── plots/               Charts from scripts/plot_results.py
